# **Layout and profile paths changed.** The old tree placed main.rs directly in bin/, while Cargo.toml
# declares `path = "src/main.rs"`. Cargo rejects the old layout:
#   error: can't find bin `sync` at path `.../src/main.rs`
# (measured 2026-09-02 with cargo 1.95.0). Moving it to src/ built in 22.9 seconds.
# After importing from the original hash, we added profile-path resolution and runtime tests.
